OL,3,GNEWSAWoman in hospital after car
OL,4,Acrashes into house
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been taken to hospital
OL,7,Fafter a car crashed into a house in
OL,8,FGreater Manchester.
OL,10,FFire crews were called to a property on
OL,11,FMansfield Road in Mossley, Tameside, at
OL,12,Fabout 11:15 BST. Images from the scene
OL,13,Fappear to show a Toyota Yaris that had
OL,14,Fcrashed through the front wall of the
OL,15,Fhouse.
OL,17,FGreater Manchester Police said the
OL,18,Fwoman's injuries were not believed to
OL,19,Fbe life-threatening or life-changing.
OL,21,FA number of emergency service crews
OL,22,Fremain at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
